{"4184810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bullet Meltdown", "steam_appid": 4184810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Meltdown </strong>is best described as<strong> Brotato meets Tower Defense,</strong> a bullet heaven arena shooter with base building, AI companions, and permanent progression. Get overpowered every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/4c4b5ff884eed0d67cedb919ea9ee071.poster.avif?t=1788341965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/4c4b5ff884eed0d67cedb919ea9ee071.webm?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/4c4b5ff884eed0d67cedb919ea9ee071.mp4?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME OVERPOWERED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a hunt for power. Tear through waves of enemies, grab coins mid-chaos, and spend them in the shop on weapons and upgrades that stack into insane combinations. Pick up rare guns  and watch your build spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, spend collected resources on permanent upgrades to your character. Each session you come back stronger. <strong>The grind is the game and the game is glorious.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master special abilities that turn the tide: dodge roll out of certain death, trigger a wave-long attack boost that supercharges every unit on the field, or stop time itself in a spectacular display of power while enemies freeze and bullets hang in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/af8810a600bd0ff07b38d66d8e2db10e.poster.avif?t=1788341965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/af8810a600bd0ff07b38d66d8e2db10e.webm?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/af8810a600bd0ff07b38d66d8e2db10e.mp4?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT INSANE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses in Bullet Meltdown are not obstacles. <strong>They are disasters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant snakes that eat walls like it's cardboard. Spiders that walk straight <i>over</i> your fortifications. Gang assaults where multiple bosses rush your base simultaneously. Surprise attacks on end of the wave. Each zone brings its own nightmare and they will tear your carefully built outpost to splinters while you scramble to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against dozens of unique enemy types engineered to disrupt your plans: armored heavies that shrug off bullets, hatching eggs that spawn mid-wave, zombies that refuse to stay dead, ghosts that blink through your walls, and suicide bombers wrapped in fire. No two areas feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/08805971970302b65e590063e179a372.poster.avif?t=1788341965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/08805971970302b65e590063e179a372.webm?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/08805971970302b65e590063e179a372.mp4?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR ARMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't fight alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit AI companions</strong>, each with unique behaviors, special abilities, and their own personality. Give them names. Hand them the rare weapon you just pulled from a run. Watch them evolve into something terrifying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place units strategically across your base: aggressive frontliners who charge enemies, support specialists who heal your defenses, coin collectors who keep the economy flowing. Back them up with walls, traps, turrets, money farms, and unit factories assembled into a fortress that fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order your troops to hold the line or throw themselves into the fight, but know that they can die.<strong> Permanently</strong>. A unit you've named, armed, and evolved can fall in seconds to a boss assault. <strong>That loss is real.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/c13fb1fdb7cda954079b7e394e45cbf9.poster.avif?t=1788341965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/c13fb1fdb7cda954079b7e394e45cbf9.webm?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/c13fb1fdb7cda954079b7e394e45cbf9.mp4?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESS EVERY RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Meltdown is built on momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new zones, each with its own roster of enemies, environmental challenges, and boss encounters waiting to punish overconfidence. Run every zone across <strong>5 difficulty tiers</strong> for greater challenge and greater rewards. Push your best builds to the limit or grind smarter, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run teaches you something. <strong>Every death makes you stronger.</strong> Every rare weapon, every named companion, every unlocked upgrade is a step toward a build that breaks the game wide open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That's Bullet Meltdown.</strong> Build. Fight. Survive. Repeat.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Meltdown </strong>is best described as<strong> Brotato meets Tower Defense,</strong> a bullet heaven arena shooter with base building, AI companions, and permanent progression. Get overpowered every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/4c4b5ff884eed0d67cedb919ea9ee071.poster.avif?t=1788341965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/4c4b5ff884eed0d67cedb919ea9ee071.webm?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/4c4b5ff884eed0d67cedb919ea9ee071.mp4?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME OVERPOWERED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a hunt for power. Tear through waves of enemies, grab coins mid-chaos, and spend them in the shop on weapons and upgrades that stack into insane combinations. Pick up rare guns  and watch your build spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, spend collected resources on permanent upgrades to your character. Each session you come back stronger. <strong>The grind is the game and the game is glorious.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master specia