8341965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/08805971970302b65e590063e179a372.webm?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/08805971970302b65e590063e179a372.mp4?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR ARMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't fight alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit AI companions</strong>, each with unique behaviors, special abilities, and their own personality. Give them names. Hand them the rare weapon you just pulled from a run. Watch them evolve into something terrifying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place units strategically across your base: aggressive frontliners who charge enemies, support specialists who heal your defenses, coin collectors who keep the economy flowing. Back them up with walls, traps, turrets, money farms, and unit factories assembled into a fortress that fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order your troops to hold the line or throw themselves into the fight, but know that they can die.<strong> Permanently</strong>. A unit you've named, armed, and evolved can fall in seconds to a boss assault. <strong>That loss is real.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/c13fb1fdb7cda954079b7e394e45cbf9.poster.avif?t=1788341965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/c13fb1fdb7cda954079b7e394e45cbf9.webm?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/extras/c13fb1fdb7cda954079b7e394e45cbf9.mp4?t=1788341965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESS EVERY RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Meltdown is built on momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new zones, each with its own roster of enemies, environmental challenges, and boss encounters waiting to punish overconfidence. Run every zone across <strong>5 difficulty tiers</strong> for greater challenge and greater rewards. Push your best builds to the limit or grind smarter, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run teaches you something. <strong>Every death makes you stronger.</strong> Every rare weapon, every named companion, every unlocked upgrade is a step toward a build that breaks the game wide open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That's Bullet Meltdown.</strong> Build. Fight. Survive. Repeat.</p>", "short_description": "Brotato meets Tower Defense in a fast-paced bullet heaven arena shooter with base building and AI-controlled troops. Get stronger every run, evolve your favorite units, collect rare weapons and survive insane boss fights.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Romanian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Hungarian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/e60e9e8b925f16cf71e5fe4e88ebe475be3410fe/header.jpg?t=1788341965", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/abfa21056b5aecea48e2520565f0778aa9b5963f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788341965", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184810/abfa21056b5aecea48e2520565f0778aa9b5963f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788341965", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla